### Auth config (if applicable)

```typescript
import { betterAuth } from 'better-auth';
  import { drizzleAdapter } from
  'better-auth/adapters/drizzle';
  import { emailOTP, multiSession, organization
   } from 'better-auth/plugins';
  import { db } from '@/lib/db';
  import {
    account,
    invitation,
    member,
    organization as organizationTable,
    session,
    user,
    verification,
  } from '@/lib/db/schema';

  export const auth = betterAuth({
    database: drizzleAdapter(db, {
      provider: 'pg',
      schema: {
        user,
        session,
        account,
        verification,
        organization: organizationTable,
        member,
        invitation,
      },
      usePlural: false,
    }),
    emailAndPassword: {
      enabled: true,
      requireEmailVerification: true,
    },
    plugins: [
      multiSession({
        maximumSessions: 3,
      }),
      organization({
        organizationLimit: 5,
      }),
      emailOTP({
        sendVerificationOnSignUp: false,
      }),
    ],
    secret: process.env.BETTER_AUTH_SECRET,
    trustedOrigins:
  [process.env.BETTER_AUTH_URL ||
  'http://localhost:3000'],
  });
```

### Additional context

The issue happens locally. All 3 sessions remain valid in the database, but listDeviceSessions() API call only returns 2.

comments.body:
This bug is still present in the latest version. I've done a deep dive into the source code and confirmed the root cause: File: packages/better-auth/src/plugins/multi-session/index.ts (lines ~306-310)

```
const currentMultiSessions = Object.keys(Object.fromEntries(cookies))
  .filter(isMultiSessionCookie).length
  + (cookieString.includes("session_token") ? 1 : 0);

if (currentMultiSessions >= opts.maximumSessions) {  // Bug: should be >
  return;
}
```

The fix is a one-character change: >= → > I'd be happy to submit a PR if a maintainer can confirm this is the right approach. Note: PR #6248 touches the same file but addresses a different issue (duplicate cookies for same account). This fix could potentially be included there, or submitted separately.

